    seoTitle: "Serious Sam Shatterverse Review Round-Up and Launch Verdict",
    metaDescription: "Read the launch-window Serious Sam Shatterverse review snapshot, Steam user review band, dated community impressions, and Devolver Digital press release pointer.",
    summary: "Read the launch-window Serious Sam Shatterverse review snapshot, Steam user review band, dated community impressions, and Devolver Digital press release pointer.",
